Cell["\<\
Elements of field can be input by pressing two letters e\[MediumSpace]e \
combination (no space in between). It then is automatically converted to \
double struck letter \[DoubleStruckF] (meaning a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote])\
\>", "Text",
